<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Thread Safety: A single <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_federated_search" kindref="compound">FederatedSearch</ref> instance is NOT thread-safe. Calls to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_federated_search_1a8cb5d92bf9920715bf331c3189348a8e" kindref="member">registerTenant()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_federated_search_1a309ca6f4bd0b1c13c5978a5737508127" kindref="member">setTenantWeight()</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1search" kindref="compound">search()</ref></computeroutput> must not occur concurrently. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Exception Safety: <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1search" kindref="compound">search()</ref></computeroutput> never throws; all per-tenant exceptions are caught internally. The constructor throws <computeroutput>std::invalid_argument</computeroutput> on invalid config values.</para>
</simplesect>
